  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Southern African Media Training Trust, NSJ, is a regional mid-career  media training institute. The overall objective of the organisation   is to contribute to improved competence and professionalism. NSJ&#xb4;s    wishes to strengthen media in its roles as communicators of           information, forum for civic action, and mobilization agent and       watchdog.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Southern African Meida Training Trust, NSJ, &#xe4;r en regional            utbildnings institution f&#xf6;r media med &#xf6;vergripande m&#xe5;l att bidra till en &#xf6;kad kompetens och professionalitet hos afrikanska journlister.    NSJ grundar sig p&#xe5; tanken att media har fyra roller: f&#xf6;rmedlare av    information, samh&#xe4;lleligt forum, mobiliserande faktor och &#xf6;vervakare.</narrative>
  </description>
